{{PageBanner|Eve l 162 en.png|event}}
'''Otherworld Colosseum''' (異次元コロシアム, ''Ijigen Koroshiamu'', '''Extradimensional Colosseum''') is an event added in the [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]]. It is unlocked after beating [[A New Legend]]. There are several different Otherworld Colosseum maps that share the same name, each consisting of 5 [[No Continues]] stages and 2 difficulty levels. The Otherworld Colosseum is one of the few sources of Dark [[Catseye]]s.

==Event Information==
Features a set of stages with a cycling ruleset. Beat back the oncoming interdimensional horde!

During this event, visit the Legend Stages from the Battle Cats title menu and select the Otherworld Colosseum map under the Special Stages section to take on this challenge.<br>
Mission Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Platinum Shard, Catseye [Dark].<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from November 1st (11:00am) until November 15th (11:59pm)!'''}}

※ You must collect rewards from completed Otherworld Colosseum missions by tapping the Claim button. Even if mission conditions have been met, rewards will not be automatically collected.<br>
※ Tap the icon at bottom left of the Otherworld Colosseum stage select screen to confirm the battle rule in effect.<br>
※ Some CatCombos may not activate due to the current ruleset.<br>
※ You must clear the "A New Legend" map found in the Uncanny Legends section of the Legend Stages section to challenge the Otherworld Colosseum.

==Mechanics==
Each Otherworld Colosseum map has a unique "rule" that applies during [[battle]]. Only one rule is applied per map.
