==Trivia==
*The Otherworld Colosseum stages' [[Backgrounds|background]] has a sky much like that of [[A Whole New World]] and animated black-and-red particles like those seen in all [[Zero Legends]] stages except A Whole New World.
*Strangely, the Otherworld Colosseum will ''not'' automatically disappear alongside other events when the app enters [[Recovery Mode|recovery mode]].
*In [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], this event ends at 11:00AM like most other events without fixed schedules, but in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], it ends at midnight instead.

